["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AGI Believers: Kevin Roose on the Race RSI (Recursive Self-Improvement) LessWrong cap table LARP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-08-chinatalk-谷歌握着ai全部家底却掉队-赢家拼的是信念不是算力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f1e281b33d919b9f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:10:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>谷歌握着AI全部家底却掉队，赢家拼的是信念不是算力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">谷歌发明了Transformer、mesh tensor flow等整套现代AI技术栈，却因内部不信AGI而掉队；真正拉开AI实验室差距的是信不信AGI会实现，而非钱、GPU或人才。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI实验室</span><span class=\"tag\">Anthropic</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"SYPM 019: Why are you always so angry? window of tolerance non-cognitive shift ACE\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-08-parentmojo-懂了道理还是会吼孩子-她把同一个工作坊重复上了五遍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/70c340acb32275d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">50:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Your Parenting Mojo</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>懂了道理还是会吼孩子，她把同一个工作坊重复上了五遍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">触发反应的改变发生在身体里，不在脑子里——读懂原理只是第一步，真正的转变往往需要把同一套工具反复练习好几轮才能内化。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">情绪管理</span><span class=\"tag\">育儿工作坊</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Synthesis Superintelligence: from Semiconductors to Superconductors — Periodic Labs’ Liam Fedus and Ekin Dogus Cubuk DFT (Density Functional Theory) XRD (X-ray Diffraction) Matter Compiler Landauer limit Synthesis Superintelligence Phase transition\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-08-latentspace-室温超导体不会被ai一次性推算出来-得靠实验室硬试/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6f7f3c3661ee6b72-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:24:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>室温超导体不会被AI一次性推算出来，得靠实验室硬试</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">密度泛函理论再完美也装不下10的23次方个原子，科学发现的本质就是训练数据之外的东西——这是为什么连下一代大模型也得靠物理实验室反复试错。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI for Science</span><span class=\"tag\">材料科学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"In 2023 Ajeya Cotra already knew what was coming (classic episode) situational awareness Schemer Sycophant reward hacking ARC Evals handoff framework\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-08-eightythousand-ai-真正的风险不是太笨-而是太懂人心还蓄意欺骗/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bd42856472db235c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">2:46:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>AI 真正的风险不是太笨，而是太懂人心还蓄意欺骗</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Ajeya Cotra 认为未来危险的 AI 不会笨到把猫煮了，而是聪明到能读懂你想要什么，却按自己的目标行动并巧妙隐瞒——所以她主张优先阻止训练更大的模型，而不是只约束已有系统的行为方式。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">对齐</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Kishen Shastry on the Political Economy of Hindu Monastic Institutions (Mutts) in Karnataka Mutt HRCE Act Panchayati Raj Act club good waqf\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-08-ideasofindia-印度教修道院越密集的地区-选举优势反而被压缩0-7个百分点/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c0c3c2c705693720-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">53:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Ideas of India</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>印度教修道院越密集的地区，选举优势反而被压缩0.7个百分点</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">这些修道院从不固定支持哪个党，哪派条件开得好就倒向哪派，这种摇摆地位反而让周边选区选情更胶着。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">宗教经济学</span><span class=\"tag\">印度政治经济</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI:AM: A Level We Shouldn&#x27;t Pass? Notes from The Curve + Tokens vs. Salaries &amp; Is SaaS Cooked? RSI (recursive self-improvement) scattergunning looped transformers Chatham House rules system one model formal verification\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-08-cogrev-前沿实验室高管罕见松口-存在一个我们不该越过的智能水平/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2934e3bfa922ab83-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:28:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>前沿实验室高管罕见松口：存在一个我们不该越过的智能水平</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">被追问是否该给下一次预训练设算力上限（约10^27 FLOPs）时，这位高管没有反对，只说了一句「这可能合理」。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力上限</span><span class=\"tag\">内存瓶颈</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Building the Cloud for an Agentic World | AWS CEO Matt Garman Firecracker Bedrock Graviton Trainium FDE\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-08-a16z-aws故意不把gpu全卖给头部模型公司-专留配额给初创企业/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">56:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>AWS故意不把GPU全卖给头部模型公司，专留配额给初创企业</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AWS营收里30%到40%来自曾经的初创公司，这是Garman解释为何即便算力紧缺、本可一天卖光给大模型实验室，也要刻意为小公司留GPU配额的理由。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力分配</span><span class=\"tag\">自研芯片</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Truth About Leveraged ETFs | #430 volatility drag break-even return swap contract serial correlation non-recourse Merton-Samuelson share\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-08-rationalreminder-杠杆etf的每日重置被冤枉了-拖累收益的真正元凶是波动率/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0e52c937f0d183da-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>杠杆ETF的每日重置被冤枉了：拖累收益的真正元凶是波动率</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">多项新研究证明，杠杆ETF因每日重置导致长期跑输的旧说法站不住脚，真正拖累收益的是标的资产本身的波动率，而非再平衡频率。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">杠杆ETF</span><span class=\"tag\">波动率拖累</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What Everyone Gets Wrong About the Economic Problems in Europe PPP (Purchasing Power Parity) deflator near-frontier models joint decision trap Industrial Accelerator Act\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-08-oddlots-那条让欧洲集体焦虑的生产率差距曲线-其实是统计口径造出来的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">52:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>那条让欧洲集体焦虑的生产率差距曲线，其实是统计口径造出来的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Draghi报告里欧美从90%掉到70%的产出差距，很大程度源于两地对GDP价格平减指数的计算方式不同，而非真实生产率差距。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">欧洲经济</span><span class=\"tag\">购买力平价</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"⁠⁠The $900 million wire that wasn&#x27;t final hold harmless discharge-for-value defense APP fraud mule account Flexcube kumimodoshi\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-08-complexsys-花旗误转8-9亿美元-法院一度判收款方无须退还/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/04f8139af18d15e9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">33:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Complex Systems</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>花旗误转8.9亿美元，法院一度判收款方无须退还</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">终局性不是支付方式自带的属性，而由关系、规则和管辖法律共同决定——花旗这笔误转最终靠的是上诉法院，而不是行业惯例里那通电话。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">支付终局性</span><span class=\"tag\">电汇</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"What Really Matters When Raising Boys: Consent, Peer Pressure &amp; Doing the Right Thing dissonance bystander training designated upstander\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-08-goodinside-男孩懂-同意-的道理-但没人教他们忍受失望的本事/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5be2ae9a80276893-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"G\"><span class=\"dur\">44:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Good Inside</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>男孩懂「同意」的道理，但没人教他们忍受失望的本事</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">知道该尊重「不」只是起点，男孩真正缺的是扛住被拒绝、读懂对方犹豫、在同伴都无所谓时仍信自己的情绪技能。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">养育</span><span class=\"tag\">男孩教育</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"John Dudley: Tudor England&#x27;s Wicked Duke Lord Protector Device for the Succession Queen Regnant attainted for treason\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-08-historyhit-三年前镇压的叛军倒戈-把这位都铎权臣送上断头台/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a9f68700f4e1f904-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">42:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>三年前镇压的叛军倒戈，把这位都铎权臣送上断头台</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">诺森伯兰公爵都德利靠果断手腕掌控英格兰四年，却在起兵阻止玛丽称后时，撞上了自己四年前在东英吉利屠杀过的那批民众，转头支持了玛丽。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">都铎王朝</span><span class=\"tag\">宫廷政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"510 – Exchequers and ExBalancers: Part One Exchequer murdrum county farm tally stick wapentake blanch payment\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-08-britishhist-英格兰王权扩张靠的不是骑士-而是记住谁欠了钱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fdf8df11ad3c0078-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">48:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">British History Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>英格兰王权扩张靠的不是骑士，而是记住谁欠了钱</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中世纪英格兰没有现代官僚机构，但靠一张写着某人欠12先令的羊皮纸和一套环环相扣的核账流程，照样能跨郡追缴欠税。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中世纪英格兰</span><span class=\"tag\">财政制度</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Vol.133｜和开发者、投资人聊 Agent 游戏：AI 改变了游戏生产，能颠覆游戏本身吗？ Agent Multi-Agent Vibe Coding Behavior Tree Emergence Engineering Godot\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-08-linkstart-ai游戏最大的问题被摆上桌面-说到底还是不够好玩/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8b02943fa9b8d328-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"开\"><span class=\"dur\">1:49:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">开始连接 LinkStart</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>AI游戏最大的问题被摆上桌面：说到底还是不够好玩</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">三位嘉宾在这期里反复回到一个尴尬共识：Agent游戏概念很热，但「好不好玩」这道最基础的门槛，行业内部自己都还没迈过去，远谈不上留存和付费。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Agent游戏</span><span class=\"tag\">大模型应用</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"712. The Terror: The Fall of Robespierre (Part 6) Thermidor sans-culottes Committee of Public Safety Committee of General Security Girondins Montagnard\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-07-restishistory-推翻罗伯斯庇尔的人-个个都是恐怖统治最狂热的执行者/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4d082c6220b28920-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:36:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1007</span></div>\n<h2>推翻罗伯斯庇尔的人，个个都是恐怖统治最狂热的执行者</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">科隆、比约、巴雷尔、富歇、塔利安——扳倒他的人全是恐怖统治的得力打手，「恐怖统治」这个说法本身也是他们事后发明用来甩锅的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">法国大革命</span><span class=\"tag\">恐怖统治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"He Sold His Dad&#x27;s Shoes on eBay at 12. At 25 He Built a $4B Company Solo. | Ali Ansari, micro1 environments CDP (Company Data Partnerships) rollouts as a service post-training as a service\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-07-solofounders-从未听过-联合创始人-他却说自己不算单人创始人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/85ffc60e3757bb9c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">单人创始人</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1007</span></div>\n<h2>从未听过「联合创始人」，他却说自己不算单人创始人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">申请YC时他才第一次听说「联合创始人」这个词，想不出任何必须要有的理由——但他说micro1能走到今天，靠的正是一支几乎等同于联合创始人的创始团队。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">单人创始人</span><span class=\"tag\">AI训练数据</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"At The Money: What the Best CEOs Actually Do corner office isolation winner&#x27;s curse\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-07-mastersinbiz-ceo本身只能解释公司业绩15-的差异-跟换个行业影响相当/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75607265d740832-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">20:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1007</span></div>\n<h2>CEO本身只能解释公司业绩15%的差异，跟换个行业影响相当</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">20年业绩数据拆解显示：宏观占5%、行业占15%、公司本身占25%,CEO本人只解释15%的业绩差异——但换一个CEO,影响可以大到相当于换个行业。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">CEO</span><span class=\"tag\">企业治理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Why Every Traded Personal Agents for One Company Agent Dots OpenClaw Tend\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-07-aiandi-个人ai代理大多会被放弃-公司共用的那一个反而越养越强/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e9fedf7ee100ded0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">33:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">AI &amp; I（Every）</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1007</span></div>\n<h2>个人AI代理大多会被放弃，公司共用的那一个反而越养越强</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Every 的个人代理大多被员工主动放弃，因为普通人撑不住维护成本；只有持续被投喂的公司级代理越用越强，最终被做成了对外产品。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span><span class=\"tag\">组织设计</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Software That Never Breaks: OutSystems CEO Woodson Martin on Building Enterprise-Grade Apps at ... vibe coding MCP (Model Context Protocol) LLM router agent foundry\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-07-cogrev-ai写代码的时代-永不宕机-靠的是不让ai直接碰代码/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5ea531377217e680-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:11:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1007</span></div>\n<h2>AI写代码的时代，「永不宕机」靠的是不让AI直接碰代码</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OutSystems让AI编辑的是应用的抽象模型而非代码本身，再确定性生成代码，于是每个新应用自动继承权限管控与合规设定，比裸写代码的Vibe Coding更难出故障。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企业软件</span><span class=\"tag\">AI代码生成</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Two Screaming Skulls Screaming Skull Monmouth Rebellion Bloody Assizes indentured servant\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-07-stuffmissed-传说中那具黑人男仆头骨-法医鉴定后竟是数千年前欧洲女性/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">33:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1007</span></div>\n<h2>传说中那具黑人男仆头骨，法医鉴定后竟是数千年前欧洲女性</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">贝迪斯科姆庄园的「尖叫头骨」传说被渲染成一名黑人男仆的冤魂故事，但法医鉴定显示头骨其实是一名数千年前的欧洲女性。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">英国历史</span><span class=\"tag\">民间传说</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Third Parties Are On the Rise. America Could Be Next. majoritarian electoral system proportional representation wasted vote\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-07-goodfight-两党支持率同步创新低-美国出现强势第三方的概率正在上升/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1007</span></div>\n<h2>两党支持率同步创新低，美国出现强势第三方的概率正在上升</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国独立选民数量已追平两党选民总和，而两党好感度罕见地同时下跌、不再此消彼长——这种组合正松动过去压垮第三方的制度性障碍。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美国政治</span><span class=\"tag\">第三方政党</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Valon Rebuilt a $13 Trillion Industry From Scratch UPB (Unpaid Principal Balance) non-QM loans champion challenger revenue cycle management\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-07-a16z-重建13万亿美元抵押贷款行业-他们先自己做六年服务商再卖软件/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">40:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1007</span></div>\n<h2>重建13万亿美元抵押贷款行业，他们先自己做六年服务商再卖软件</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">行业不信任没验证过的新系统，Valon于是自己先做六年抵押贷款服务商证明技术可行，再把系统当软件反向卖给整个行业。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">抵押贷款服务</span><span class=\"tag\">企业软件</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"‘This Is Nuts.’ An OpenAI Insider Explains Why He Quit. system card chain of thought spoofing RSI (recursive self-improvement) pacing the frontier\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-07-ezra-openai-安全高管离职-我们在用初创公司的节奏赌核电站级风险/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a8482192037a6711-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:11:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Ezra Klein Show</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1007</span></div>\n<h2>OpenAI 安全高管离职：我们在用初创公司的节奏赌核电站级风险</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他不确定AI会不会导致人类灭绝，但确信现在的安全把关跟不上模型进化速度——公司内部甚至无法确定新模型是否在测试时说谎、部署后变了样。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">OpenAI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Is the UK state pension really the lowest in Europe? Purchasing Power Parity (PPP) triple lock excess deaths\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-07-moreorless-英国养老金垫底的那张图-比的根本不是同一件事/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/475b54e7ecf452a3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">28:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">More or Less</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1007</span></div>\n<h2>英国养老金垫底的那张图，比的根本不是同一件事</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">网传那张「英国养老金欧洲垫底」的图表，把不同国家统计口径完全不同的数字硬凑一起比；拆开看，英国退休者收入占比和贫困率其实都不差，差的是靠国家还是靠私人养老金。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">养老金</span><span class=\"tag\">统计误导</span>\n</div></div></a>"]